*receive* | V-$CHIPVR ($CHIPCN)

''receive(blocking)''

Drains all pending messages from the current actor's inbox.

*Parameters:*
- ''blocking'': ''true'' to block until at least one message arrives, ''false'' to return immediately

*Returns:*
- List: All pending messages (empty list if none available in non-blocking mode)

*Errors:*
- Runtime error if blocking is not a number
- Runtime error if ''receive(true)'' is cancelled by the deadlock detector (no actor can still send)
